<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 4.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on June 4.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				  June 4		 June 3</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.298		  5.470</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  12.868		 15.630</p>
<p>Cash balance		  17.165		 21.101</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,272.212	     5,270.444</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $200 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
